    "theorem": "RhoNonzeroSupportAudit.nonzero_support_certificate",
    "statement": "theorem nonzero_support_certificate : (∀ (p : ℕ) [Fact p.Prime], ensembleMean p ≤ nonzeroMean p + 2) ∧ (∀ (p : ℕ) [Fact p.Prime] [Fact (2 < p)], nonzeroMean p = ∑ f : NonzeroEmbedding p, (uniformLaw (NonzeroEmbedding p) f).toReal * ∑ h : Hash (ZMod p) (Fin 2), (hashLaw fair fair_nonneg fair_sum h).toReal * (firstCollision p (fun x => x + (f (h x)).val) 0 : ℝ)) ∧ (∀ (p : ℕ) [Fact p.Prime] (m : ℕ), 3 ≤ m → 4 * m^2 * (4 * m + 1) ≤ p → (m : ℝ)^2 / 4 ≤ nonzeroMean p) ∧ (∀ C : ℕ, ∃ p : ℕ, ∃ hp : p.Prime, 2 < p ∧ (C : ℝ) * p < (@nonzeroMean p ⟨hp⟩)^2) ∧ (¬∃ K : ℝ, 0 ≤ K ∧ ∀ p : ℕ, ∀ hp : p.Prime, 2 < p → @nonzeroMean p ⟨hp⟩ ≤ K * Real.sqrt p) ∧ (∀ (p : ℕ) [Fact p.Prime], finiteMean (fun z : TwoSupport p => if ¬Good z then (1 : ℝ) else 0) = 2 / p) ∧ (Fintype.card (NonzeroSupport 2) = 0 ∧ Fintype.card (NonzeroSupport 3) = 2)",
    "decl_sha256": "29cb895f96ba2ac7281a8b977ab8fe18e9dadb2d4502b638f4003e4a2bfb51b5",
    "scope": "Actual uniform ordered distinct both-nonzero increments in prime Z/p forp>2, independent actual fair static binary vertex hashes, actual leastrepeat from0. Explicit actual conditioned-coordinate/nonzero-embedding bijection and actual uniformsupport PMF×vertexproduct PMF; actual p>2population witnesses, p2empty/p3exacttwo supports kernelchecked. EmptyfiniteMean atp2 is not a normalizedprobabilitylaw. Exact discarded zero-containing support mass2/p derived using nonzerodifference and distinct excluded firstpoints0,−δ; actual table first-repeat means nonnegative≤p. Established finite conditional-mean/cardinality lemma derives Eall≤Enonzero+2, not supplied as a premise. Credited preceding actual zeroallowed Eall≥m²/2 atp≥4m²(4m+1) yields Enonzero≥m²/2−2 form>0,≥m²/4 form≥3. Bertrand gives for every naturalC some primep>2 with Enonzero²>Cp and no realnonnegative uniformsqrtbound. This is a domainrefinement of existing r2negativecalibration; establishedconditioning/oldmaximal-path-count-deferreddecisions/Bertrand methods and known results credited, no novelty/independentnewcounterfamily claim. Qualified source nS≥8/20 largerpartition conjectures remainopen. No Floydoperation/cyclealone/scalarrecovery/practicalhashruntime conclusion. Fournewconcrete modules/17frozenlocalmodules0copies/32oldformalconfigs/51oldformal-artifactpins checkedbeforeafterall3states/fullgate. Complete explicit827character mainheader/nativefullcheck; unchangedfrozenverifier. Foundations/defaults only/noholes/customaxioms/nativeproofeval/raisedlimits/globalflags/waivers/frozenedits/cryptoPython/newsolverbenchmark/spend/upload/newhost/compilerrefinement/canonicalpromotion/full14claim. Largerpartitioncollisionconstants/practicalhash/remaining14 remainopen.",
